<title>USA: Dowagiac Building, Mich., won by Old Kent Bank.</title>
<headline>Dowagiac Building, Mich., won by Old Kent Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Old Kent Bank said it won $1.600 million of Dowagiac Building Authority, Mich., 1997 building authority bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.1626 percent.</p>
